<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Modular ablation study. format., init. and cur. represent formatted text description, reinitialization and curriculum learning in CL-VAE respectively.</figcaption>
